{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"241","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Old Peykan"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" cities in the country where the Old Peykan lives. These cities are located on a straight line, we'll denote them from left to right as "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c1, c2, ..., cn"},{"kind":"text","text":". The Old Peykan wants to travel from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c1"},{"kind":"text","text":" to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"cn"},{"kind":"text","text":" using roads. There are "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(n - 1)"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"one way"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" roads, the "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"i"},{"kind":"text","text":"-th road goes from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" to city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci + 1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"di"},{"kind":"text","text":" kilometers long."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The Old Peykan travels 1 kilometer in 1 hour and consumes 1 liter of fuel during this time."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"ci"},{"kind":"text","text":" (except for the last city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"cn"},{"kind":"text","text":") has a supply of "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"si"},{"kind":"text","text":" liters of fuel which immediately transfers to the Old Peykan if it passes the city or stays in it. This supply refreshes instantly "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"text","text":" hours after it transfers. The Old Peykan can stay in a city for a while and fill its fuel tank many times. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initially (at time zero) the Old Peykan is at city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c1"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s1"},{"kind":"text","text":" liters of fuel is transferred to it's empty tank from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c1"},{"kind":"text","text":"'s supply. The Old Peykan's fuel tank capacity is unlimited. Old Peykan can not continue its travel if its tank is emptied strictly between two cities."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Find the minimum time the Old Peykan needs to reach city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"cn"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of the input contains two space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"k"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ m, k ≤ 1000)"},{"kind":"text","text":". The value "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" specifies the number of roads between cities which is equal to "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n - 1"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The next line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"d1, d2, ..., dm"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ di ≤ 1000)"},{"kind":"text","text":" and the following line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" space-separated integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"s1, s2, ..., sm"},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"(1 ≤ si ≤ 1000)"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the only line of the output print a single integer — the minimum time required for The Old Peykan to reach city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"cn"},{"kind":"text","text":" from city "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c1"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"4 6\n1 2 5 2\n2 3 3 4\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"10\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 3\n5 6\n5 5\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"14\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second sample above, the Old Peykan stays in "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"c1"},{"kind":"text","text":" for 3 hours."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"241A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/241/problem/A"}